          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>How long until I see results?</p><p>Most people see visible whitening after their first 30-minute session. Full results (3–5 shades lighter) typically take 3–5 days of daily use.</p><p>Is it safe? Will it damage my teeth?</p><p>Yes, it's safe. The whitening formula is the same concentration used in professional dental offices. The LED light is non-UV and designed for at-home use.</p><p>What if I'm not happy with it?</p><p>30-day money-back guarantee. If you're not satisfied for any reason, email us. We'll process a full refund within 3–5 business days, no questions asked.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/faq\">View All FAQs →</a></p>"
          }
        }
